    "created_at": "2023-03-22T15:02:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-22T15:04:48Z",
    "body": "In our code, we encode query params using [EscapeQueryParamValue](https://crsrc.org/c/base/strings/escape.cc;drc=b4bc946c63b2b95e1f05dec4e84adcadd10499c6;l=471) with its use_plus parameter set to true to encode space as \"+\". It does use `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`.\r\n\r\nThis is the [spec](https://github.com/WICG/turtledove/pull/480/files#diff-6f5a1d8263b0b0c42e2716ba5750e3652e359532647ac934c1c70086ae3ceddaR571) that I'd like to use [=UTF-8 percent-encode=]",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
