    "updated_at": "2023-03-22T15:20:16Z",
    "body": "I guess what I'm wondering is if you can use https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-urlencoded-serializer as entry point, similar to HTML.\r\n\r\nLooking at the callers of what you point to it seems to be inventing its own key/value format with commas instead of ampersands. That's precisely the kind of thing we'd like to avoid.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
