    "created_at": "2023-03-22T16:46:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-22T16:46:32Z",
    "body": "I mean, that is a new format. Multiple values are encoded by repeating the key in `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`.\r\n\r\nSince it seems like this is a new technology, it seems like there would still be time to adapt.",
