    "updated_at": "2023-03-23T01:15:43Z",
    "body": "I'd suggest using platform infrastructure as much as you can. This means: (1) yes, use `&key1=value1&key1=value2`, since that's the standard format; (2) use `%20`, not `+`, since that's what the standard does.",
