    "updated_at": "2023-03-23T06:21:04Z",
    "body": "I think using https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-urlencoded-serializer and assigning that to URL's query is fine. That gives you `+`.\r\n\r\n(I think #491 is still inaccurate in that it assumes the key-value format is somehow larger than `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`. It's not clear we should do that.)",
